msgctxt "604\t694"
msgid "Strange place, China."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "711\t804"
msgid "Wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "818\t878"
msgid "You people eat anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884\t1012"
msgid ""
"Pigeons, frogs. Hell, even cats and dogs\\n"
"end up on the dinner table."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1109\t1207"
msgid "Whatever it takes to keep yourselves alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240\t1303"
msgid "But you know, man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304\t1479"
msgid "I have to hand it to you Chinese snakes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1630\t1768"
msgid ""
"Laying down roots in someone else's\\n"
"country takes serious balls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1903\t2007"
msgid "That's a mafia-level move right there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2017\t2077"
msgid "I not mafia!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2098\t2163"
msgid "I just chef!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2317\t2438"
msgid "Let's be pals, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2467\t2630"
msgid ""
"All your neighbors are on board.\\n"
"They pay their dues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2667\t2727"
msgid "A million a month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2735\t2794"
msgid "A million!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2795\t2992"
msgid ""
"Considering how long you've been yanking\\n"
"our fucking chain... It's a pretty good deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3009\t3126"
msgid ""
"But I'd gladly take the deed to this\\n"
"little shithole if you can't pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3127\t3262"
msgid ""
"There's a job in one of our\\n"
"restaurants with your name on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3279\t3363"
msgid "No! It not possible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3568\t3721"
msgid "Sometimes I forget how sharp Chinese knives can be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3799\t3920"
msgid "Could probably slice a man's head clean off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3948\t4025"
msgid "How about we test it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4347\t4510"
msgid ""
"Your food's got quite a reputation\\n"
"around these parts, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5052\t5152"
msgid "Boss. We just received a call from HQ."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5153\t5227"
msgid "They want to discuss the sixth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5427\t5501"
msgid "Please, it not possible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5562\t5622"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5708\t5790"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5815\t5911"
msgid "If you can't do it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5912\t5965"
msgid "You can't do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6193\t6349"
msgid ""
"Sorry I had to go shaking\\n"
"you up like this, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6424\t6568"
msgid ""
"This'll make it up to you.\\n"
"Something to remember me by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6664\t6803"
msgid "All I wanted was to be partners, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6866\t6945"
msgid "My bad if I came on too strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7174\t7266"
msgid "Let me know if you change your tune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7268\t7328"
msgid "Bye now."
msgstr ""